<p class="MsoNormal" style="MARGIN: 2pt 0cm 2pt 14.2pt; TEXT-INDENT: -14.2pt"><span style="FONT-SIZE: 9pt; COLOR: black; FONT-FAMILY: FoundryMonoline-Regular; LETTER-SPACING: 0.3pt; mso-fareast-language: EN-GB">-Charges for additional baggage are payable each
