<p>Regulation 2027/97 (as amended by Regulation 889/02), the Warsaw Convention or the Montreal Convention may apply to your carriage and limits the liability of airlines for death or personal injury, loss of or damage to baggage, and for delay.<br>
No financial limit applies to Virgin Atlantic's liability for proven damages for death or personal injury. Virgin Atlantic's liability for loss, damage to or delay of checked and unchecked baggage is limited to a maximum of 1,131 SDRs per passenger. Baggage
